       <h1>Emiway Bantai Teams Up with Sachin-Jigar for 'Udta Teer' Track</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Music</span> <span>#Film</span> <span>#Collaboration</span></div>
       <p>The much-anticipated film 'Udta Teer', featuring Ayushmann Khurrana and Sara Ali Khan, is set to introduce a fresh musical collaboration that merges distinct soundscapes. Rapper Emiway Bantai will be joining forces with the acclaimed composer duo Sachin-Jigar for a new track featured in the movie.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-22/emiway-bantai-teams-up-with-sachin-jigar-for-udta-teer-track.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This partnership is particularly noteworthy as it unites an established name within Bollywood's music industry, Sachin-Jigar, with one of the prominent voices from India’s burgeoning independent hip-hop scene, Emiway Bantai. The collaboration signals a dynamic fusion of styles, potentially offering a unique auditory experience for the film's soundtrack.</p><p>The integration of an independent artist like Emiway Bantai into a mainstream Bollywood production starring notable actors such as Khurrana and Khan reflects an evolving trend within the industry. It suggests an openness to diverse musical influences and a desire to appeal to a wider audience base. This creative alliance is expected to generate considerable buzz among music enthusiasts and filmgoers alike, anticipating the innovative sound that will emerge from this unique blend of talent.</p><p>What to watch: The release of the track and its reception among fans of both Bollywood and independent hip-hop.</p>
       
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/features/emiway-bantai-joins-sachin-jigar-for-a-new-track-in-ayushmann-khurrana-and-sara-ali-khan-starrer-udta-teer/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
