       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-09-22 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Lionel Richie Hospitalized for Third Time, Undergoes Heart Procedure</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Lionel Richie</span> <span>#Health</span> <span>#Hospitalization</span> <span>#Atrial Fibrillation</span></div>
       <p>Music icon Lionel Richie has reportedly been hospitalized for the third time in three months, according to recent reports. The singer is currently undergoing a heart procedure to address atrial fibrillation, a condition characterized by an irregular heartbeat. This marks a significant health concern for Richie, necessitating immediate medical attention.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-22/lionel-richie-hospitalized-for-third-time-undergoes-heart-pr.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The recurrence of his health issues has directly impacted his touring schedule. As a result of his latest hospitalization and the procedure, three upcoming shows featuring Lionel Richie alongside Earth, Wind &amp; Fire have been canceled. These performances were part of their ongoing tour, indicating the need for Richie to focus on his recovery rather than his professional commitments.</p><p>Atrial fibrillation is a medical condition that requires careful management, and Richie's repeated hospitalizations underscore the seriousness of his situation. The cancellations reflect the impact on his ability to perform while undergoing treatment. Fans and the music community are undoubtedly wishing the renowned artist a swift and full recovery from his current health challenges.</p><p>What to watch: Keep Lionel Richie in your thoughts for a quick return to health and the stage.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is a faithful and accurate summary of the provided text.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/english/hollywood/news/lionel-richie-hospitalised-for-third-time-in-three-months-with-irregular-heartbeat-undergoes-afib-heart-procedure-earth-wind-fire-cancel-three-tour-shows/articleshow/134416377.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
