     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-09-22 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Shastri Bhawan, Krishi Bhawan Demolition Imminent for Central Vista Revamp</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Central Vista</span> <span>#Shastri Bhawan</span> <span>#Krishi Bhawan</span> <span>#Demolition</span></div>
       <p>The demolition of Shastri Bhawan and Krishi Bhawan is set to commence shortly as part of the ambitious Central Vista redevelopment project. This significant step marks a new phase in the government's plan to transform the administrative heart of the national capital. The two prominent government buildings are slated for removal to make way for new structures envisioned under the ongoing revamp.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-22/shastri-bhawan-krishi-bhawan-demolition-imminent-for-central.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The Central Vista project encompasses a comprehensive overhaul of the area, including the construction of new facilities and the redevelopment of key public spaces. The demolition of existing structures like Shastri Bhawan and Krishi Bhawan is a critical component of this large-scale urban planning initiative, designed to modernize and consolidate government infrastructure.</p><p>Shastri Bhawan currently houses several key ministries, while Krishi Bhawan is home to the Ministry of Agriculture and Farmers Welfare. Their demolition indicates a strategic move towards consolidating government offices and modernizing infrastructure within the Central Vista precinct. The timeline for the commencement of these demolitions suggests an acceleration of the overall project, which has been under development for some time.</p><p>This phase of the Central Vista revamp underscores the government's commitment to creating a more efficient and integrated administrative complex. The project aims to enhance functionality and aesthetics, reflecting contemporary architectural and urban planning standards. The upcoming demolitions are a tangible sign of progress in this extensive redevelopment effort.</p><p>What to watch: The precise timeline for the demolition and subsequent construction activities.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately reflects the source summary regarding the Central Vista revamp and upcoming demolitions.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/shastri-bhawan-krishi-bhawan-demolition-central-vista-kartavya-bhawans-ptag-3000433-2026-09-22?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
